WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.060 --> 00:00:05.759
Hey youtubers it’s Charlie and yesterday
in my Arrow video I asked you all to submit

00:00:05.759 --> 00:00:06.759
questions.

00:00:06.759 --> 00:00:10.160
So I picked 10 to answer in this video with
one bonus questions.

00:00:10.160 --> 00:00:14.210
We also just found out when Merlyn is coming
back.

00:00:14.210 --> 00:00:18.810
If you’re finding me for the first time
I do Q&amp;A videos a couple times a week.

00:00:18.810 --> 00:00:20.880
Be sure to subscribe to get everything.

00:00:20.880 --> 00:00:24.369
My countdown series starts next wednesday
too.

00:00:24.369 --> 00:00:26.980
So before we answer questions there’s just
been a huge news update.

00:00:26.980 --> 00:00:28.710
Malcolm Merlyn will be back in Episode 22,
based on the description, Thea is going to

00:00:28.710 --> 00:00:31.460
run into him or he’ll run into her.

00:00:31.460 --> 00:00:35.030
We can talk more about that in the comments,
but until now I almost didn’t think he’d

00:00:35.030 --> 00:00:36.030
show up until the finale.

00:00:36.030 --> 00:00:40.600
So we’ll have to wait and see what happens
before we can guess what Merlyn will do in

00:00:40.600 --> 00:00:41.600
the finale.

00:00:41.600 --> 00:00:45.560
Whether he’ll fight with Team Arrow against
Slade or do something totally different.

00:00:45.560 --> 00:00:48.940
And now, to questions!

00:00:48.940 --> 00:00:52.030
Careful for spoilers from the episode if you
haven’t seen it yet.

00:00:52.030 --> 00:00:58.420
Question 1 - Drew Cole asks Do you thin laurel
will tell Oliver she knows he's the arrow

00:00:58.420 --> 00:01:00.920
or will she just keep it to herself?

00:01:00.920 --> 00:01:04.470
I think she’ll listen to Quentyn and just
keep it to herself.

00:01:04.470 --> 00:01:07.850
When she went to hug him you could tell she
wanted to support him.

00:01:07.850 --> 00:01:11.930
If she had told him he’d probably be too
distracted worrying about her to fight Slade.

00:01:11.930 --> 00:01:17.030
Add to that all the extra problems with Queen
Industries, Thea and Roy right now and you

00:01:17.030 --> 00:01:19.119
arrive at Hug Time.

00:01:19.119 --> 00:01:22.049
The best thing she could have done for him
in that moment, was just give him a hug.

00:01:22.049 --> 00:01:24.430
And she did, which is why it was such a good
moment.

00:01:24.430 --> 00:01:28.859
I think her relationship with Team Arrow will
be like Quentyn’s in Season 3, except she’ll

00:01:28.859 --> 00:01:30.950
know who they are, but they won’t know that
she knows.

00:01:30.950 --> 00:01:33.189
She’ll be a stealth team Arrow member.

00:01:33.189 --> 00:01:36.429
So stealth that Oliver won’t even know she’s
on the team.

00:01:36.429 --> 00:01:42.170
Question 2 - Baby Maker asks why does Oliver
keep calling Thea speedy?

00:01:42.170 --> 00:01:46.209
Speedy is his affectionate little sister nickname
for her.

00:01:46.209 --> 00:01:48.780
He uses it whenever he wants to show her he
cares about her.

00:01:48.780 --> 00:01:51.299
It’s one of the ways he shows brotherly
affection.

00:01:51.299 --> 00:01:55.310
It’s not meant to imply she’s going to
become the Speedy character from the comic

00:01:55.310 --> 00:01:56.310
books at some point.

00:01:56.310 --> 00:02:00.399
I know a lot of you are wondering if she’ll
become the Artemis character at some point

00:02:00.399 --> 00:02:01.399
too.

00:02:01.399 --> 00:02:04.289
I think we’ll have to wait till after this
season to guess where her character is going.

00:02:04.289 --> 00:02:06.189
Especially her relationship with Merlyn.

00:02:06.189 --> 00:02:15.920
Although I think that situation will be like
Oliver’s Father choosing his family over

00:02:15.920 --> 00:02:16.920
Isabel Rochev.

00:02:16.920 --> 00:02:19.090
Thea will just be forced to choose between
Merlyn and her family.

00:02:19.090 --> 00:02:22.540
I don’t think he’s going to train her
or anything like that.

00:02:22.540 --> 00:02:27.080
If she ever did become a Team Arrow member,
it would be way more fun to watch Oliver train

00:02:27.080 --> 00:02:28.080
her like he’s training Roy.

00:02:28.080 --> 00:02:31.400
Just imagine her slapping endless bowls of
water.

00:02:31.400 --> 00:02:35.230
Question 3 - Sharmilan (no avatar) asks What
about the bandage on Roy's arm?

00:02:35.230 --> 00:02:39.380
Could be to do with the clone that CADMUS
makes?

00:02:39.380 --> 00:02:43.129
So you’re thinking like a Superman Superboy
situation.

00:02:43.129 --> 00:02:48.629
That would be interesting, but I think they’d
only clone a meta human.

00:02:48.629 --> 00:02:50.220
Like someone with actual superpowers.

00:02:50.220 --> 00:02:52.920
And Roy is just juiced up on Mirakuru.

00:02:52.920 --> 00:02:57.519
The bandages are probably just where they
attached the machine to his veins.

00:02:57.519 --> 00:03:01.360
I think if there end up being any cloning
storylines in the future, especially with

00:03:01.360 --> 00:03:05.360
STAR Labs involved, they’ll use them as
Flash crossover opportunities.

00:03:05.360 --> 00:03:07.280
So it would have to be some big epic thing.

00:03:07.280 --> 00:03:13.930
That seems like a little too complicated for
the show to tackle in it’s first season,

00:03:13.930 --> 00:03:17.610
The Flash that is, but it could always happen
in the future.

00:03:17.610 --> 00:03:23.299
Question 4 - Legitimate Gamer asks How did
Slade get inside the Arrow Cave if he didn’t

00:03:23.299 --> 00:03:27.560
have one of those super keys like the one
Felicity stole off The Clock King?

00:03:27.560 --> 00:03:34.310
He’s ex-special forces and the mirakuru
has made him almost indestructible.

00:03:34.310 --> 00:03:38.610
But even before he became a super soldier
he had experience in breaking into places.

00:03:38.610 --> 00:03:42.520
Mostly to kill people I imagine, like he almost
did to Team Arrow.

00:03:42.520 --> 00:03:47.079
The only reason he broke in was to spank them
for setting his operation back.

00:03:47.079 --> 00:03:50.760
That’s why he had to raid STAR Labs for
that device.

00:03:50.760 --> 00:03:53.599
I loved that Felicity stole that key technology
off the Clock King though.

00:03:53.599 --> 00:03:57.190
It just reminds us that she knows an opportunity
when she sees one.

00:03:57.190 --> 00:04:00.769
Like window shopping for cool toys.

00:04:00.769 --> 00:04:04.959
Question 5 - Green Quiver asks How do you
think Danielle panabaker will become Killer

00:04:04.959 --> 00:04:06.129
Frost?﻿

00:04:06.129 --> 00:04:12.359
This is where things get really interesting,
because she totally seems like one of the

00:04:12.359 --> 00:04:13.760
good guys based on her relationship with Felicity
and Cisco.

00:04:13.760 --> 00:04:17.799
Since she’s such a big character from the
comics, yes eventually she’ll become a version

00:04:17.799 --> 00:04:19.310
of Killer Frost.

00:04:19.310 --> 00:04:22.590
But I think on the show, she’s going to
start out being good.

00:04:22.590 --> 00:04:28.110
The real question is what her character arc
is going to be.

00:04:28.110 --> 00:04:32.810
Like good person researcher, then she gets
in a horrible accident and turns evil.

00:04:32.810 --> 00:04:36.560
Or is she just a normal person that gets corrupted
by Zoom or someone else.

00:04:36.560 --> 00:04:43.750
There’s also the possiblity that they could
be messing with the character and just call

00:04:43.750 --> 00:04:50.669
her “Frost” like the way Green Arrow became
just “The Arrow” on the show.

00:04:50.669 --> 00:04:53.070
I think that’s more likely.

00:04:53.070 --> 00:04:57.490
When you use the name Killer Frost, you kind
of telegraph what a character’s story will

00:04:57.490 --> 00:05:04.460
be and I think they want it to be more of
a mystery for us as fans.

00:05:04.460 --> 00:05:10.130
No matter what happens, I think she’ll be
a normal human for most of the first season.

00:05:10.130 --> 00:05:14.770
I think The Flash and Zoom will be the only
real super powered people for a while.

00:05:14.770 --> 00:05:20.190
I think any Rogues that pop up will just be
using tech, like Arthur Light’s tech they

00:05:20.190 --> 00:05:21.530
had locked up in storage.

00:05:21.530 --> 00:05:26.310
As opposed to being full on meta-humans.

00:05:26.310 --> 00:05:29.289
They did say there would eventually be more
superpowered people on the show though.

00:05:29.289 --> 00:05:30.610
Just not right away.

00:05:30.610 --> 00:05:35.419
Question 6 - Fsniper asks Do you think team
arrow will use the cure for Slade and use

00:05:35.419 --> 00:05:37.320
it on Roy?

00:05:37.320 --> 00:05:42.310
I think we should ask if they’re going to
have to pick which one to use it on, like

00:05:42.310 --> 00:05:44.849
they’ll have to either cure Slade or Roy,
but not both.

00:05:44.849 --> 00:05:47.980
Logically you’d think they’d be able to
synthesize a ton of it.

00:05:47.980 --> 00:05:51.380
And now that we know there really is a cure,
I think that’s how Oliver will get rid of

00:05:51.380 --> 00:05:52.910
all the new Super Soldiers.

00:05:52.910 --> 00:05:57.490
So let’s just say they’ll have a bunch
of it, enough to do Roy and Slade.

00:05:57.490 --> 00:06:02.570
I definitely think they’ll cure Roy, Colton
Haynes isn’t leaving the show.

00:06:02.570 --> 00:06:06.130
He’s still got to finish his Jedi Training
so he can become Arsenal.

00:06:06.130 --> 00:06:11.110
As for Slade, I think everyone even the writers
want him to be able to continue on as the

00:06:11.110 --> 00:06:15.349
Deathstroke character, but a slightly less
insane version.

00:06:15.349 --> 00:06:17.920
So I think they’ll end up using the cure
on him too.

00:06:17.920 --> 00:06:21.889
They won’t kill him and he’ll just dissapear
the same way Merlyn did after season 1.

00:06:21.889 --> 00:06:25.030
They’ll just leave it open for him to return
in the future.

00:06:25.030 --> 00:06:27.360
I don’t think he’ll be around a lot in
Season 3 though.

00:06:27.360 --> 00:06:29.840
They’ll make room for new villains to come
in.

00:06:29.840 --> 00:06:34.479
Question 7 - Danielle Mawdesley (no avatar)
asks do you think Laurel will confront Sara

00:06:34.479 --> 00:06:37.139
about being The Canary before the end of the
season?

00:06:37.139 --> 00:06:44.199
I think we’ll get a Spider-Man 2 situation,
the Tobey Maguire Spider-Man 2.

00:06:44.199 --> 00:06:47.940
Remember when he was saving Mary Jane from
Doctor Octopus and his mask came off and she

00:06:47.940 --> 00:06:50.190
saw it was him and they had that moment.

00:06:50.190 --> 00:06:52.639
I think they’ll do a reverse version of
that.

00:06:52.639 --> 00:06:57.979
It will be more from Sara’s perspective,
since Laurel already knows it’s her.

00:06:57.979 --> 00:07:01.360
They’ll have a sister moment when Sara gets
unmasked in battle.

00:07:01.360 --> 00:07:04.229
I’m expecting something like that to happen
in the finale.

00:07:04.229 --> 00:07:11.250
But until then, I think Laurel will treat
her just like she’s treating Oliver.

00:07:11.250 --> 00:07:15.800
Question 8 - Harsh asks Do you think Oliver
will become Mayor of the city like in the

00:07:15.800 --> 00:07:17.699
comics?

00:07:17.699 --> 00:07:19.850
Only if Moira is the one to die this season.

00:07:19.850 --> 00:07:24.159
There’s still a funeral scene in episode
21, we don’t know who it’s a funeral for,

00:07:24.159 --> 00:07:27.580
it could be Slade doing a fake funeral for
Isabel Rochev.

00:07:27.580 --> 00:07:30.199
So that he can surprise them with Ravager
later.

00:07:30.199 --> 00:07:32.940
Otherwise I think they’ll give that Mayor
storyline to Moira like they are right now.

00:07:32.940 --> 00:07:35.050
I don’t think she’s the most interesting
character, and yes I do think Oliver as mayor

00:07:35.050 --> 00:07:37.310
would be more interesting.

00:07:37.310 --> 00:07:39.550
But we’ll have to just wait and see.

00:07:39.550 --> 00:07:43.980
Question 9 - Lizbeth (no avatar) asks Producers
have hinted that Felicity's backstory is going

00:07:43.980 --> 00:07:48.409
to be a big thing for season 3 but could we
possibly get a cliff hanger about this in

00:07:48.409 --> 00:07:49.409
the finale?

00:07:49.409 --> 00:07:54.680
Definitely, the major arc for next season
always gets teed up by what happens during

00:07:54.680 --> 00:07:56.800
the finale.

00:07:56.800 --> 00:08:02.439
So whatever the resolution of the Slade storyline
is, it will be related to Felicity’s backstory.

00:08:02.439 --> 00:08:06.669
Maybe in just a minor way, but keep your eyes
peeled for special Felicity stuff in episode

00:08:06.669 --> 00:08:07.879
23.

00:08:07.879 --> 00:08:13.949
I’m really hoping that her Father is the
season 3 villain and is someone connected

00:08:13.949 --> 00:08:15.220
to HIVE.

00:08:15.220 --> 00:08:20.060
Question 10 - Schmoley (no avatar) asks With
a Booster Gold tv series supposedly in the

00:08:20.060 --> 00:08:24.189
works, do you think we'll see a cameo in Flash
or Arrow?﻿ (prob flash)

00:08:24.189 --> 00:08:28.340
Booster Gold always spent more time in the
Flash comics, so if he shows up anywhere it

00:08:28.340 --> 00:08:29.340
would be there.

00:08:29.340 --> 00:08:33.720
That episode could also be an Arrow Crossover,
just to guarantee the show a bigger audience,

00:08:33.720 --> 00:08:35.610
but I don’t think we’ll see him until
Season 2.

00:08:35.610 --> 00:08:39.490
I don’t think they’ll try to complicate
The Flash storyline in season 1 by throwing

00:08:39.490 --> 00:08:41.409
in a ton of new characters right away.

00:08:41.409 --> 00:08:47.990
But Geoff Johns has been trying to get a Booster
Gold show going for a long time, so you’ll

00:08:47.990 --> 00:08:50.070
see him eventually.

00:08:50.070 --> 00:08:53.850
Bonus Question - Vaughan O’Hara asks Do
you think we will see any more Flash characters

00:08:53.850 --> 00:08:55.000
this season?

00:08:55.000 --> 00:09:00.079
I think the only Flash Crossover we’ll see
the rest of the season is one, for the mirakuru

00:09:00.079 --> 00:09:07.360
cure from STAR Labs and two Felicity actually
going to visit Barry.

00:09:07.360 --> 00:09:09.230
I don’t think they’ll show that, they’ll
just have a scene where she says she’s going

00:09:09.230 --> 00:09:12.940
to Central City to visit him.

00:09:12.940 --> 00:09:16.241
So thanks so much for submitting questions
guys, I always like being able to answer you

00:09:16.241 --> 00:09:17.779
directly in a video.

00:09:17.779 --> 00:09:20.850
Like I said, next week I’ll start posting
bonus Arrow Videos each Wednesday morning

00:09:20.850 --> 00:09:22.460
counting down to the finale.

00:09:22.460 --> 00:09:27.180
Be sure to subscribe to get them if you just
finding me for the first time.

00:09:27.180 --> 00:09:31.900
Right now click here for my review of the
episode and click here for my finale predictions.

00:09:31.900 --> 00:09:34.220
Thanks for watching, see you guys tomorrow.

00:09:34.220 --> 00:09:34.890
High Fives!

